-5. TOON vs JSON — The New Format Designed for AI. dev.to, 2025. [dev.to/akki907/toon-vs-json-the-new-format-designed-for-ai-nk5](https://dev.to/akki907/toon-vs-json-the-new-format-designed-for-ai-nk5)
