+## Publication caveats
+
+- The 5-token and 44.5% to 46.6% values remain checked-in historical fixture measurements, not tokenizer results independently reproduced in this revision.
+- The session simulator is an estimate conditional on its hard-coded constants, query mix, and eviction model.
+- No repository-local MCP adapter, definitions, prompt snapshot, host trace, or aligned workload establishes a transport-wide token winner.
+- README.md and SKILL.md still repeat stale MCP claims; they require a separate documentation correction.
